  (text "Blue Pill plugs into two 1x20 female headers, 15.24 mm (0.6 in) apart. USB goes to the PC (USB CDC for the Python UI) and also powers the Blue Pill."
    (at 25 110.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 4bf36c42-93ec-428a-8e57-ca081bfc2055))
  (text "JP801 is normally OPEN: the Blue Pill 5V pin is wired straight to USB VBUS, so the board must not feed it while a PC is connected (review item U-01). Close JP801 only to run without USB."
    (at 25 114.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 32efed70-1928-43f8-9da9-32a39289e6b8))
  (text "ADC: PA0 I_MON, PA1 V_FAST, PA2-PA5 NTCs. PWM \"DACs\": PA6 load setpoint, PA7 charger voltage, PB0 charger current limit (TIM3). PA8 fans (TIM1). PB8 Peltier PWM (TIM4), PB9 Peltier direction."
    (at 25 119.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9dee689e-eeff-4dcd-abd0-93d71f381def))
  (text "PB6/PB7 I2C1 (ADS1115 0x48). PB12 K1_EN, PB13 K2_EN. PB14 LOAD_OFF (open drain, 5 V pull-up, low = load on). PB15 FAULT_N (input). PB10 ARM (high-Z; pulse high = arm, low = trip)."
    (at 25 123.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 45f98c45-fcaa-4ae0-9eb6-41721ddb9dc4))
  (text "How it works / what to check: docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 8."
    (at 25 128.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 67e0c772-806c-4103-b1ed-c5a42d2e8f85)))
